<p id="p2">Today, Apple announced the finalists for the Apple Design Awards in six categories:</p>
<ul id="ul3"><li>Delight and Fun</li>
<li>Inclusivity</li>
<li>Innovation</li>
<li>Interaction</li>
<li>Social Impact</li>
<li>Visuals and Graphics</li>
</ul><p id="p4">Each category includes three finalists for a total of 18 apps and games from across Apple’s platforms:</p>
